Package: luajit
Version: @DEB_LUAJIT_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Interpreters
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://luajit.org/
Description: LuaJIT runtime and command-line interpreter
 LuaJIT is a tracing Just-In-Time compiler for Lua 5.1. This iOS build uses
 upstream's iPhoneOS/aarch64 target path and installs the runtime dylib, CLI,
 and standard JIT support modules under the rootless prefix.
